          work, check the current policy on the product page or with the store before you buy.
        </aside>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="In this guide">
          <h2>In this guide</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">Should You Buy a Treadmill at Best Buy?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#strengths-weaknesses">What an Electronics Retailer Is Good and Bad At</a></li>
            <li><a href="#screens-and-specs">Look Past the Screen</a></li>
